<mjml>
  <mj-head>
    <mj-style>
      .j-btn td, .j-btn a { background-image:linear-gradient(90deg, #a5ee2e 0%, #70ad0c 100%) !important; }
      @media only screen and (max-width:480px) {
        .j-p1 { padding-top:8px !important; padding-bottom:16px !important; }
        .j-p1 div { font-size:13px !important; line-height:17px !important; }
        .j-p1 div div { max-width:245px !important; }
        .j-cm { width:13% !important; }
        .j-cc { width:35.25% !important; }
        .j-cg { width:3.5% !important; }
        .j-ch { font-size:10.5px !important; line-height:12px !important; padding-top:7px !important; padding-bottom:7px !important; }
        .j-cl { font-size:10px !important; line-height:12px !important; padding-top:5px !important; padding-bottom:12px !important; }
        .j-csp { height:3px !important; line-height:3px !important; }
        .j-btn table { width:200px !important; }
        .j-btn a { width:198px !important; font-size:13px !important; line-height:15px !important; padding:12px 0px 12px 0px !important; }
        .j-btn1 { padding-top:6px !important; padding-bottom:48px !important; }
        .j-faixa div { letter-spacing:0.8px !important; line-height:22px !important; }
        .j-bul { padding-top:13px !important; padding-bottom:9px !important; }
        .j-bul div { font-size:21px !important; line-height:36px !important; }
        .j-dot { width:9px !important; height:9px !important; border-radius:5px !important; margin-right:11px !important; vertical-align:3px !important; }
        .j-p3 { padding-top:40px !important; }
        .j-p3 div { font-size:14.5px !important; line-height:19px !important; }
        .j-p3 div div { max-width:250px !important; }
        .j-btn2 { padding-top:16px !important; }
        .j-ps { padding-top:10px !important; }
        .j-ps div { font-size:12px !important; line-height:15px !important; }
        .j-leg { padding-top:20px !important; }
        .j-leg div, .j-opt div { font-size:10px !important; line-height:15px !important; }
        .j-opt { padding-bottom:16px !important; }
      }
      @media only screen and (max-width:359px) {
        .j-p1 div { font-size:12.5px !important; line-height:16px !important; }
        .j-p1 div div { max-width:236px !important; }
        .j-ch { font-size:9.5px !important; line-height:11px !important; }
        .j-cl { font-size:9px !important; line-height:11px !important; }
        .j-faixa div { font-size:8px !important; }
        .j-bul div { font-size:18px !important; line-height:31px !important; }
        .j-dot { width:8px !important; height:8px !important; border-radius:4px !important; margin-right:9px !important; }
        .j-p3 div { font-size:13.5px !important; line-height:18px !important; }
        .j-p3 div div { max-width:234px !important; }
        .j-btn table { width:190px !important; }
        .j-btn a { width:188px !important; font-size:12.5px !important; }
      }
    </mj-style>
  </mj-head>
  <mj-body background-color="#000000" width="600px">

    <mj-section background-color="#000000" padding-top="0px" padding-right="0px" padding-bottom="0px" padding-left="0px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-image src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0968/7354/6003/files/joie-b17-topo.jpg" alt="Black Friday Joie: todo o site com 30% OFF" width="600px" href="https://www.joiesuplementos.com.br/produtos/c" padding-top="0px" padding-right="0px" padding-bottom="0px" padding-left="0px"></mj-image>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-section background-color="#000500" background-url="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0968/7354/6003/files/joie-b17-fundo-brindes.jpg" background-size="100% 100%" background-position="center top" background-repeat="no-repeat" padding-top="0px" padding-right="0px" padding-bottom="0px" padding-left="0px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text css-class="j-p1" align="center" font-family="'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="17.5px" line-height="24px" color="#ffffff" padding-top="13px" padding-right="24px" padding-bottom="34px" padding-left="24px"><div style="max-width:322px; margin:0 auto;">Na Black Joie, o valor do seu carrinho também <strong style="font-weight:700;">pode desbloquear presentes:</strong></div></mj-text>
        <mj-raw><tr><td style="padding:0;" class="fc-html-block"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="width:100%;"><tr><td class="j-cm" width="112" style="width:18.67%;"></td><td class="j-cc" width="176" valign="top" style="width:29.33%;"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="width:100%; background-color:#010401; border-radius:12px;"><tr><td class="j-ch" align="center" style="background-color:#a5ee2e; border-radius:12px 12px 8px 8px; padding:9px 3px 10px 3px; font-family:'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:16px; color:#000000; text-align:center;">COMPRAS ACIMA<br>DE <strong style="font-weight:700;">R$699,90</strong></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:0; font-size:0; line-height:0;"><a href="https://www.joiesuplementos.com.br/produtos/c" target="_blank"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0968/7354/6003/files/joie-b17-robo.jpg" width="176" alt="Robô aspirador" style="display:block; width:100%; max-width:176px; height:auto; border:0;"></a></td></tr><tr><td class="j-cl" align="center" valign="top" background="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0968/7354/6003/files/joie-b17-base-1.jpg" bgcolor="#01290c" style="background-color:#01290c; background-image:url('https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0968/7354/6003/files/joie-b17-base-1.jpg'); background-size:100% 100%; background-position:center; background-repeat:no-repeat; padding:6px 2px 20px 2px; font-family:'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:11px; line-height:14px; color:#ffffff; text-align:center;">Ganham <strong style="font-weight:700; color:#a5ee2e;">Robô Aspirador</strong></td></tr></table></td><td class="j-cg" width="24" style="width:4%;"></td><td class="j-cc" width="176" valign="top" style="width:29.33%;"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="width:100%; background-color:#010401; border-radius:12px;"><tr><td class="j-ch" align="center" style="background-color:#a5ee2e; border-radius:12px 12px 8px 8px; padding:9px 3px 10px 3px; font-family:'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:16px; color:#000000; text-align:center;">COMPRAS ACIMA<br>DE <strong style="font-weight:700;">R$899,90</strong></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:0; font-size:0; line-height:0;"><a href="https://www.joiesuplementos.com.br/produtos/c" target="_blank"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0968/7354/6003/files/joie-b17-relogio.jpg" width="176" alt="Smartwatch" style="display:block; width:100%; max-width:176px; height:auto; border:0;"></a></td></tr><tr><td class="j-cl" align="center" valign="top" background="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0968/7354/6003/files/joie-b17-base-2.jpg" bgcolor="#01290c" style="background-color:#01290c; background-image:url('https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0968/7354/6003/files/joie-b17-base-2.jpg'); background-size:100% 100%; background-position:center; background-repeat:no-repeat; padding:6px 2px 20px 2px; font-family:'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:11px; line-height:14px; color:#ffffff; text-align:center;">Ganham <strong style="font-weight:700; color:#a5ee2e;">Smartwatch</strong></td></tr></table></td><td class="j-cm" width="112" style="width:18.67%;"></td></tr><tr><td class="j-csp" colspan="5" style="height:4px; font-size:1px; line-height:4px;">&nbsp;</td></tr></table></td></tr></mj-raw>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-section background-color="#000000" padding-top="0px" padding-right="0px" padding-bottom="0px" padding-left="0px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-image src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0968/7354/6003/files/joie-b17-produtos.jpg" alt="CreaGEN, HEPRO, Morning Shot e Colágeno Verisol da Joie" width="600px" href="https://www.joiesuplementos.com.br/produtos/c" padding-top="0px" padding-right="0px" padding-bottom="0px" padding-left="0px"></mj-image>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-section background-color="#010e05" background-url="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0968/7354/6003/files/joie-b17-fundo-botao.jpg" background-size="100% 100%" background-position="center top" background-repeat="no-repeat" padding-top="0px" padding-right="0px" padding-bottom="0px" padding-left="0px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-button css-class="j-btn j-btn1" href="https://www.joiesuplementos.com.br/produtos/c" background-color="#8acd1d" color="#000000" font-family="'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="19px" font-weight="700" line-height="21px" border="1px solid #c4e68d" border-radius="16px" inner-padding="20px 0px 20px 0px" width="299px" align="center" padding-top="10px" padding-right="0px" padding-bottom="79px" padding-left="0px">APROVEITAR 30% OFF</mj-button>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-section background-color="#a9dc2a" padding-top="0px" padding-right="0px" padding-bottom="0px" padding-left="0px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text css-class="j-faixa" align="center" font-family="'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="9px" letter-spacing="2px" line-height="30px" color="#0d1a06" padding-top="0px" padding-right="10px" padding-bottom="0px" padding-left="10px">ATÉ 10X SEM JUROS • +3% OFF NO PIX • FRETE GRÁTIS</mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-section background-color="#020302" padding-top="0px" padding-right="0px" padding-bottom="0px" padding-left="0px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-image src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0968/7354/6003/files/joie-b17-aproveita.jpg" alt="E você também aproveita" width="600px" padding-top="0px" padding-right="0px" padding-bottom="0px" padding-left="0px"></mj-image>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-section background-color="#020302" background-url="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0968/7354/6003/files/joie-b17-fundo-card.jpg" background-size="100% 100%" background-position="center top" background-repeat="no-repeat" padding-top="0px" padding-right="10.667%" padding-bottom="0px" padding-left="10.667%">
      <mj-column background-color="#040503" border-left="1px solid #3b3e36" border-right="1px solid #292a29" border-bottom="1px solid #292a29" border-radius="0 0 22px 22px">
        <mj-text css-class="j-bul" align="center" font-family="'Helvetica Neue Condensed', 'Roboto Condensed', 'Arial Narrow', 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif" font-size="34px" font-weight="700" line-height="57px" color="#ffffff" padding-top="18px" padding-right="4px" padding-bottom="15px" padding-left="4px"><span class="j-dot" style="display:inline-block; width:14px; height:14px; border-radius:7px; background-color:#a9dd2a; vertical-align:5px; margin-right:18px;"></span>ATÉ 10X SEM JUROS<br><span class="j-dot" style="display:inline-block; width:14px; height:14px; border-radius:7px; background-color:#a9dd2a; vertical-align:5px; margin-right:18px;"></span>+3% OFF NO PIX<br><span class="j-dot" style="display:inline-block; width:14px; height:14px; border-radius:7px; background-color:#a9dd2a; vertical-align:5px; margin-right:18px;"></span>FRETE GRÁTIS</mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-section background-color="#0e1306" background-url="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0968/7354/6003/files/joie-b17-fundo-final.jpg" background-size="100% 100%" background-position="center top" background-repeat="no-repeat" padding-top="0px" padding-right="0px" padding-bottom="0px" padding-left="0px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text css-class="j-p3" align="center" font-family="'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="22px" line-height="30px" color="#ffffff" padding-top="66px" padding-right="24px" padding-bottom="0px" padding-left="24px"><div style="max-width:370px; margin:0 auto;">Ou seja: é hora de garantir os produtos que estavam na sua lista e <strong style="font-weight:700; color:#a9dd2a;">ainda levar um presente para casa.</strong></div></mj-text>
        <mj-button css-class="j-btn j-btn2" href="https://www.joiesuplementos.com.br/produtos/c" background-color="#8acd1d" color="#000000" font-family="'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="19px" font-weight="700" line-height="21px" border="1px solid #c4e68d" border-radius="16px" inner-padding="20px 0px 20px 0px" width="299px" align="center" padding-top="22px" padding-right="0px" padding-bottom="0px" padding-left="0px">APROVEITAR 30% OFF</mj-button>
        <mj-text css-class="j-ps" align="center" font-family="'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="16px" font-style="italic" line-height="20px" color="#ffffff" padding-top="18px" padding-right="10px" padding-bottom="0px" padding-left="10px">Brindes enquanto durarem os estoques.</mj-text>
        <mj-text css-class="j-leg" align="center" font-family="'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="11px" line-height="17px" color="#8a8a8a" padding-top="24px" padding-right="32px" padding-bottom="0px" padding-left="32px"><span style="white-space:nowrap;">JOIE SUPLEMENTOS LTDA</span> · <span style="white-space:nowrap;">CNPJ 26.907.772/0001-03</span><br><span style="white-space:nowrap;">Rua Itapura, 1053</span> · <span style="white-space:nowrap;">Vila Gomes Cardim</span> · <span style="white-space:nowrap;">São Paulo/SP</span> · <span style="white-space:nowrap;">03310-000</span></mj-text>
        <mj-text css-class="j-opt" align="center" font-family="'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="11px" line-height="17px" color="#8a8a8a" padding-top="0px" padding-right="32px" padding-bottom="17px" padding-left="32px">Você recebeu este e-mail porque se cadastrou ou comprou na Joie Suplementos.<br><a href="{{link_optout}}" style="color:#a9dd2a; text-decoration:underline;">Não quero mais receber</a></mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

  </mj-body>
</mjml>
